notes:        Rendered with REELWRIGHT_UI_SNAPSHOT_DIR=<dir> cargo test -p reelwright-ui-egui --test readme_shots (1600x1000, wgpu harness) from apps/reelwright-web/web/samples/demo-cut.fcproj, the built-in demo project. Everything on screen is generated by the editor itself (built-in demo scenes, no third-party media); the UI font is Inter (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork.
